  "releaseNotes": "0.2.1\n- Cancellation exceptions thrown from the spin path now carry the caller's CancellationToken, so `e.CancellationToken` is consistent regardless of the requested delay.\n- Fixed a handle leak and a missing wait-handle unregistration in the asynchronous WaitableTimer path.\n- Fixed integer overflow in the timestamp/deadline arithmetic and added a three-stage fallback for WaitableTimer creation.\n- Added `UsleepWin.MaxTailSpinMicroseconds` and enforced it as the upper bound for the tail-spin setting.",
